          "line": "Hello?"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Decon chamber"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Sel treoght da-techt."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Ehj ocuuz sahfi?"
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Guzah louz."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "La ruvah tahp!"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Sickbay"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Ingala habi."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Who are you?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Ingala duk habi?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "I don't understand."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Duk habi nakustra?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "What?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Bok, megoron duk what I'm saying?"
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Sit down!"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Who the hell are you?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Who we are is unimportant. Do you command this ship?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "I'm the captain."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "What have you done to my crew?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "They're sleeping. They won't be harmed as long as you cooperate."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "What do you want?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Where is the location of your vault?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Vault? I don't know what you're talking about."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Maybe the translator's malfunctioning."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "He understands."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "This is a vessel of exploration not a cargo ship. We don't do any commerce. Whatever it is you're after, you won't find it here."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "You carry no valuables of any kind? No precious gems, no latinum?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "I just told you."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Liar!"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Whoever you are, just take what you want and get off of my ship."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Cousin, maybe we should. We've made some good acquisitions already."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "There's more here. He's hiding something."
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "I agree with Krem. Let's take what we have and go."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "What do we have? Scanners, low-grade weapons."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Nothing but trinkets."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Don't forget about the females. Some of them are worth their weight in latinum. If we leave now we can make the next slave market on Stameris."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Slave market?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "You're right, Krem. Pick out the females that will bring the best price."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "I already have."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "It was a pleasure doing business with you."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Wait."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "You've reconsidered?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "I'll show you where the vault is, if you let me keep half the gold."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Gold-pressed latinum?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Gold bars. Hundreds of them. But I keep half."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Ten percent."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Forty."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Fifteen."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Thirty five and not a bar less. You'll never find the vault without my help."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Twenty percent. Final offer."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "No deal. I'd rather you take the women and go."
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "Thirty-five percent. That's not a bad offer, Ulis. Maybe we should consider it."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "No. We'll find the vault ourselves. Krem, start loading the merchandise."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Why am I always stuck doing the menial labor?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Make him do it."
        }
      ],
      "location": "Launch bay"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Oh, not there. Over here."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "If you're going to make a habit out of this, you might want to get a bigger ship."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "It's not my ship. It's my cousin's."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Really. I was getting the impression you were in charge."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "This is only my first month on the job."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "How do you like it so far?"
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "My cousin's a skillful merchant. I'm learning a lot from him. You'd better slide that over to make room for the others."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "What do you need all this for, anyway? You seem to already have plenty of technology."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "One can never have too much. The Rules of Acquisition say 'Expand or die'."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Rules of Acquisition?"
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "That's rule number forty five. I've memorized all a hundred and seventy three, including the most important one. A man is only worth the sum of his possessions."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Back on my home world that kind of thinking almost destroyed our civilisation."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "You should've managed your businesses better. Come on. We have a lot more moving to do."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "We?"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Alien cargo bay"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "So what do you do, split the profits equally between the four of you?"
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Oh, my cousin determines the shares."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "You must get a bigger percentage than your crewmates."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Actually, I get the smallest."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Oh, that doesn't seem fair. You're the one doing all the work."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "My cousin knows what's best for me. He manages all my financial transactions."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Really."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "I don't have the lobes for business."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "I assume he charges you for his services."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Of course."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "He wouldn't be a very good businessman if he didn't. Never allow family to stand in the way of profit."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Another one of your rules?"
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Number six. My cousin's going to help me acquire my own ship some day."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Do you think you could bring me a glass of water?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "It comes out of a dispenser in the mess hall."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "I'll be right back."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Oh, do you think you could bring me some food while you're at it? Whatever's left in the serving case. That is, if you haven't already taken everything."
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "You all right, Captain?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Never better. You?"
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "From what I can tell, you and I are the only ones on the ship still standing. I would've tried to wake some of the others but there's nothing left in Sickbay to do it with."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "I'm not surprised. These aliens are taking everything they can get their hands on."
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "Who are they?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "I don't know yet. Can you get a phase pistol?"
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "They've cleaned out the armory."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "There are fourteen weapons lockers on this ship. They can't have emptied every one of them."
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "Trust me, Captain, I've already checked."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "I've got an idea, but you're going to need some help to pull it off. They used a hypospray to wake me up. It's in Launch bay two."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "This is pretty good."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Glad you're enjoying it."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Maybe we should take your cook with us."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Do you mind?"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Corridor"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "T'POL",
          "line": "Commander."
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "You're going to be fine. Just because a guy's in his underwear you think the worst."
        },
        {
          "character": "T'POL",
          "line": "I assume you have an explanation."
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "Doctor Phlox made me clear bio-scan after I got back from that lunar survey. While I was in decon, something knocked out the entire crew. Aliens are in control of the ship."
        },
        {
          "character": "T'POL",
          "line": "That artifact you brought back from the lunar surface. It must have been placed there intentionally. When I opened it, the canister released some kind of gas."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "This female is different from the others. What species is she?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "She's a Vulcan."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "Vulcan."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "They're really not all that interesting once you get to know them."
        },
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "I'd like to get to know this one. Maybe I won't sell her. Not right away."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Trust me. She's got no sense of humor. She's always complaining."
        },
        {
          "character": "ARCHER",
          "line": "Krem."
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "You okay?"
        },
        {
          "character": "T'POL",
          "line": "There are times I wish Vulcans hadn't learned to repress their violent tendencies."
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "Come on, we've got work to do."
        },
        {
          "character": "T'POL",
          "line": "What about the others?"
        },
        {
          "character": "TUCKER",
          "line": "I can't wake anybody else up. This hypospray is empty. Let's go, unless you want to be sold into slavery."
        }
      ],
      "location": "Launch bay"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "There's nothing here."
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "You're not scanning deep enough. This is their vault. I saw one just like it on a Gavarian ship."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Why would they keep a vault in the medical bay?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Rule of Acquisition number twenty three. Nothing is more important than your health, except for your money."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "I don't see a locking mechanism."
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "It must use some sort of magnetic seal. I'll need micro-charges to blow it open."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Hold on."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "This is a waste of time. We've only got three hours before they begin to wake. It'll take days to search every hatch."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "We'll find it, Muk. Be patient. Open those."
        }
      ],
      "location": "Sickbay"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "Empty.",
          "modifier": "screen"
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Ah! I found something.",
          "modifier": "screen"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Gold?",
          "modifier": "screen"
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "No,",
          "modifier": "screen"
        }
      ],
      "location": "unidentifiable place"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "But it looks like quality merchandise. (A gun-type thing with a very long nozzle.)"
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Splendid craftsmanship."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Add it to the pot."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Do I look like a Menk to you? This beauty's going in my personal collection."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "We agreed to split our profits."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "You said this ship would make us rich. We'll be lucky if we break even."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "We had a deal."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "I'm amending it. Anything I find, I keep."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Fine. I'll just deduct it from your share of the gold."
        }
      ],
      "location": "Sickbay"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "What's wrong, Ulis? Can't find your pot of gold?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "What's all this?"
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey! Don't touch."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "If you're not going to help us you should return to the ship. And what are you doing?"
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "Looking for the vault."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "They're not going to put it on a map, you idiot."
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "I know that, but look. If I'm not mistaken these are the Captain's quarters."
        }
      ],
      "location": "Situation room"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "So?",
          "modifier": "voiceover"
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "That's where you keep your latinum.",
          "modifier": "voiceover"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Outside the Bridge"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "What's the quickest route?"
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "We could take this elevator to this deck"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Situation room"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "And cut through here.",
          "modifier": "voiceover"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "It's worth a look.",
          "modifier": "voiceover"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Outside the Bridge"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Weapons! Where is it coming from?"
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "Over here!"
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "Make it stop!"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Let's get to their Captain's quarters."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Where are my scanners? I left them right here!"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "You should be more careful with your acquisitions."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Oh, oh! Open your bag."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "No."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Open it."
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Are you calling me a thief?"
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Everybody knows you'd steal the wax out of your own mother's ears."
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "Please, gentlemen. We're partners."
        }
      ],
      "location": "Situation room"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Partners don't rob from each other.",
          "modifier": "voiceover"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "Why would I bother taking some worthless scanners?",
          "modifier": "voiceover"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Outside the Bridge"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Worthless?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "I didn't put them there."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Oh, really? Then who did?"
        },
        {
          "character": "ULIS",
          "line": "I tell you, I don't know."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Maybe they just jumped off the table and crawled inside. Where's the other one? There were three."
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "Don't look at me."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Give it back."
        },
        {
          "character": "GRISH",
          "line": "Get away."
        },
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "Come back here!"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Situation room"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "MUK",
          "line": "You heard me, you no-good cheating liar!",
          "modifier": "voiceover"
        }
      ],
      "location": "Outside the Bridge"
    },
    {
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "character": "KREM",
          "line": "There. That one."
